{"claim": {"claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-LOAD-REPETITION", "version": "1.4.2", "statement": "在给定动作条件并接近疲劳的用力情况下，一组能够完成的重复次数与负荷存在反向关系；不同负荷后的次数不属于相同测试任务。\n因此换成更重配重后次数减少，本身不能直接证明个人力量退步。可先保留负荷和次数事实，再在可比任务及测量条件下评价变化；该综述不提供个人确定换算或成功概率。", "scope": {"population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs", "aggregation": "group_evidence"}, "limitations": ["实际核对来源及其范围；不构成个人最优数字、临床处方或一次训练因果效果证明。"], "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}], "answer_task": {"subject": "resistance_training", "outcome": "load_repetition_relation", "requested_relation": "explanation", "evidence_relation": "supports", "answer_complete": true, "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "text": "在给定动作条件并接近疲劳的用力情况下，一组能够完成的重复次数与负荷存在反向关系；不同负荷后的次数不属于相同测试任务。", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}, {"part_id": "2", "text": "因此换成更重配重后次数减少，本身不能直接证明个人力量退步。可先保留负荷和次数事实，再在可比任务及测量条件下评价变化；该综述不提供个人确定换算或成功概率。", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}]}}, "review": {"content_checked": true, "independent_expert_validation": false, "rationale": "Actually read exact S1/HHS spans and scope; separate initial benefit/long-t