{"claim": {"claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-ADULT-SCOPE", "version": "1.4.2", "statement": "S1纳入至少18岁、无已定义疾病的健康成人，并明确排除其所定义的肥胖、肌少症和身体衰弱；不能把这个人群范围自动扩展为青少年、疾病或衰弱人群已验证方案。\n综述包括不同训练经历，但大量证据来自经验较少者。其群体结果仍需要按个人目标和情况调整，不能从没有病历推断健康，也不能将未提供训练经历当成已知。", "scope": {"population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs", "aggregation": "group_evidence"}, "limitations": ["实际核对来源及其范围；不构成个人最优数字、临床处方或一次训练因果效果证明。"], "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00067", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"]}], "answer_task": {"subject": "resistance_training", "outcome": "population_scope", "requested_relation": "scope", "evidence_relation": "supports", "answer_complete": true, "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "text": "S1纳入至少18岁、无已定义疾病的健康成人，并明确排除其所定义的肥胖、肌少症和身体衰弱；不能把这个人群范围自动扩展为青少年、疾病或衰弱人群已验证方案。", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00067", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"]}, {"part_id": "2", "text": "综述包括不同训练经历，但大量证据来自经验较少者。其群体结果仍需要按个人目标和情况调整，不能从没有病历推断健康，也不能将未提供训练经历当成已知。", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00067", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"]}]}}, "review": {"content_checked": true, "independent_expert_validation": false, "rationale": "Actually read exact S1/HHS spans and scope; separate initial benefit/